# New Feature

Create a feature spec and feature-tagged tasks.

## Inputs To Gather

- feature name in kebab-case
- short description
- requirements
- acceptance criteria
- out-of-scope items
- dependencies or ticket references

If the user already provided enough detail, do not re-ask.

## Files To Update

Create:

- `{{DOCS_PATH}}/feature_docs/<feature-name>/SPEC.md`

Append tasks to:

- `{{DOCS_PATH}}/ROADMAP.md`

## Feature Spec Shape

```markdown
# Feature: <feature-name>

## Requirements

- [ ] ...

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] ...

## Out Of Scope

- ...

## Dependencies

- ...

## Implementation Notes

- ...

## Verification

- ...
```

## Roadmap Task Shape

```markdown
- [ ] <task> [feature: <feature-name>]
```

## Guardrail

After creating the spec and tasks, summarize what changed and ask before starting implementation.
